& [PostP4ReadinessSurfaceV1] is the current readiness surface after P4 whole-field planning and packetization acceptance
  + [surface_state] is ready_for_next_deeper_reasoning_design_selection
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is PostP3ReadinessSurfaceV1
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is P4WholeFieldPlanningPacketizationFinalSliceSurfaceV1
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is P4PacketizationBoundaryImportAndGapReconciliationV1
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is P4WorkPacketEnvelopeAndReadinessPacketizationContractV1
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is P4CompletionReviewDeltaGateAndRebakeTriggerContractV1
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is P4ManagerHandoffAndNoDispatchPacketBoundaryContractV1
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is P4PacketTraceFixtureOracleAndNoLiveEffectPlanV1
  + [active_implementation_chunk] is none
  + [current_ready_chunk] is P8 proof fixtures evaluation and faults final slice minting
  + [secondary_ready_chunk] is P5 LangGraph procedure runtime after P8 fixture pack planning and fixture material authority advance
  + [secondary_ready_chunk] is P6 surface projection expansion after P8 fixture pack planning and projection fixture records advance
  + [gated_chunk] is P7 dispatch-adjacent coordination expansion until dispatch authority is source-preserved and accepted
  + [gated_chunk] is P9 operations live-control reconsideration until separate source-preserved live-control authority is accepted
  + [gated_chunk] is fixture source file creation until future source-preserved implementation activation explicitly opens files
  + [gated_chunk] is dependency installation, package metadata mutation, adapters, transports, UI, assignment, dispatch, operations control, and live machine control until explicit accepted authority opens bounded work
  + [safety_limit] is no assignment, dispatch, operations control, or live machine control authorized

  = must: choose the next slice from current support, completed-work deltas, and whole-field dependency closure
  = must: run completion review after each new design, planning, proof, or implementation slice before opening downstream slices
  = must: preserve P4 packet envelope, completion review delta gate, rebake trigger, no-dispatch handoff boundary, and no-live-effect fixture oracle in downstream work
  = must: keep work packets as reviewable records, not assignment, dispatch, operations-control, or live-control commands

& [ReadinessChunk: P8ProofFixturesEvaluationAndFaults] is ready_for_slice_minting
  + [chunk_id] is P8
  + [chunk_name] is proof fixtures evaluation and faults
  + [dependency_set] is P2 authority kernel and record schemas
  + [dependency_set] is P3 compiled SOP operator contracts
  + [dependency_set] is P4 whole-field planning and packetization
  + [expected_output_set] is source-preserved P8 final slice surface
  + [expected_output_set] is fixture pack generation contract and path policy
  + [expected_output_set] is stale and false-ready fault case plan
  + [expected_output_set] is proof output ledger plan
  + [model_route] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [model_route_reason] is P8 decides when planned fixture obligations become material fixtures, generated outputs, proof ledgers, and nonpromotion rules that downstream runtime and surfaces depend on
  + [future_Spark_suitable_work] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable fixture material creation only after P8 source-preserved implementation activation accepts file paths, expected ledgers, and no-live-effect proof boundaries
  + [forbidden_scope] is fixture source file creation, expected ledger creation, implementation code, dependency installation, package metadata mutation, adapter implementation, transport implementation, UI implementation, command execution, process control, GPU control, model runtime mutation, job dispatch, credential access or mutation, network exposure mutation, destructive filesystem action, persistent automation, operations control, and live machine control

  = must: source-preserve, SJS-process, and final-slice P8 before trusting fixture work as current authority
  = must: keep generated fixture traces non-authoritative until reviewed
  = must: include no-assignment, no-dispatch, no-live-effect, false-ready, stale, contradicted, ambiguous, contested, and rebake-required cases

& [PostP4PacketizationStatus] is the accepted P4 status for downstream design
  + [packet_boundary_import_status] is accepted
  + [work_packet_envelope_status] is accepted_contract_only
  + [completion_review_delta_gate_status] is accepted_contract_only
  + [manager_handoff_no_dispatch_status] is accepted_contract_only
  + [fixture_oracle_status] is accepted_plan_only
  + [work_packet_candidate_status] is reviewable_record_only
  + [ready_for_claim_status] is coordination_readiness_only
  + [assignment_status] is not_authorized
  + [dispatch_status] is not_authorized
  + [operations_control_status] is not_authorized
  + [live_control_status] is not_authorized

  = must: require downstream P5, P6, P7, P8, and P9 planning to consume P4 packet field, delta gate, rebake trigger, handoff, no-dispatch, and no-live-effect boundaries explicitly
  = must: mark downstream designs stale if P4 source, packet envelope, completion gate, handoff boundary, fixture oracle, completion review, or this readiness surface changes

& [PostP4SafetyBoundary] is the safety boundary after P4 acceptance
  + [packet_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [LangGraph_node_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [fixture_source_file_creation_authorized] is false
  + [expected_ledger_file_creation_authorized] is false
  + [generated_database_creation_authorized] is false
  + [dependency_installation_authorized] is false
  + [package_metadata_mutation_authorized] is false
  + [adapter_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [transport_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [UI_implementation_authorized] is false
  + [assignment_authorized] is false
  + [manager_dispatch_authorized] is false
  + [agent_dispatch_authorized] is false
  + [job_dispatch_authorized] is false
  + [operations_control_authorized] is false
  + [live_machine_control_authorized] is false

  = must: treat P4 outputs as packetization and planning authority, not runtime, graph, storage, adapter, dispatch, operations-control, or live-control authority
  = must: reject packet success, fixture plan success, graph checkpoint state, generated output, carrier message, dry-run evidence, or human approval display as dispatch or live-control authority

& [PostP4ReadinessClosureReview] is the dependency audit for the post-P4 readiness surface
  + [P4-S01_status] is accepted
  + [P4-S02_status] is accepted
  + [P4-S03_status] is accepted
  + [P4-S04_status] is accepted
  + [P4-S05_status] is accepted
  + [P4_completion_status] is accepted_after_review
  + [current_ready_chunk_set] is P8 proof fixtures evaluation and faults final slice minting
  + [conditionally_ready_chunk_set] is P5 LangGraph procedure runtime after P8 fixture pack planning and material authority advance
  + [conditionally_ready_chunk_set] is P6 surface projection expansion after P8 fixture pack planning and projection fixture records advance
  + [unresolved_external_dependency_set] is empty_after_gate
  + [forbidden_external_dependency_found] is false
  + [assignment_authorized] is false
  + [manager_dispatch_authorized] is false
  + [agent_dispatch_authorized] is false
  + [operations_control_authorized] is false
  + [live_machine_control_authorized] is false

  = must: treat implementation activation, adapter work, transport work, UI work, dispatch authority, live-control authority, and downstream operations execution as gated, not ready
  = must: rerun closure review when a P4 boundary pack changes, proof fails, or packetization contradiction appears
